sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant AN as answerer.py
    participant RET as Retrieval - local
    participant LLM as LLM provider
    participant TR as Trust layer

    U->>FE: Ask question
    FE->>API: POST /query
    API->>AN: answer_question

    par Speculative retrieval
        AN->>RET: dense on raw question + tsvector
        RET-->>AN: 60 candidates
    and Query rewriting
        AN->>LLM: condense + expand
        LLM-->>AN: standalone question + 3 variants
    end

    AN->>RET: dense on variants, RRF fuse, rerank top 10
    RET-->>AN: ranked hits + top_score
    AN->>AN: abstention gate

    alt top_score below 0.30 without consensus
        AN-->>FE: abstained + near-miss + suggestions
    else passes gate
        AN->>AN: assemble 4 sources, 3000 tok
        AN->>LLM: grounded prompt, stream
        loop per token
            LLM-->>AN: token
            AN-->>FE: SSE token
            FE-->>U: text appears
        end
        AN->>TR: validate completed sentences - concurrent
        TR-->>AN: support + conflicts
        AN->>TR: compute confidence
        TR-->>AN: label + components
        AN-->>FE: sources, citation markers, confidence, trace
    end
